el completely off except for the  scarf which we'll get to but you know  the coat the hat that's like a little  too floppy doesn't feel like it properly  contains his hair like maybe with the  hair like that he shouldn't even be  wearing a hat but he does  and it fits his personality wonderfully  but then the addition of the scarf the  scarf that is impossible to miss it's  impossible to ignore no matter what else  you think of everything else he's  wearing  that scarf  grabs attention and that scarf is iconic  for good  reason  the length of it the flow of it the  pattern on it it's perfect  and they did alterations to this look he  had slightly different similarly long  scarfs for later seasons i still like  this one the best  when i think  what does the doctor look like  even though  my favorite doctor is a different one i  am way more familiar with the modern  eras than the classic  this is still the image that comes to my  head first  given that i can't put it anywhere other  than first  absolutely stellar iconic look that you  would not mistake for anything else from  any other show  ever  and i think it's the best  what about you  what are your favorite outfits that the  doctor has worn or what do you think  about my ranking if you want to tell me  how wrong i am either way that works too  drop something down in the comments  let's talk about it patreon is how i am  able to do this and keep the entire  operation up and running any amount of  support is incredibly helpful  um but you know there's other things if  you want to support me as well like  share subscribe there's links to other  things in the description such as twitch  i have a coffee now um you know  instagram tick tock all those things  um i appreciate any and all of it but  you also don't have to  because my friends no matter how you  chose to get dressed up today  you are the council  i'm just running the meetings  and until next time this council  is adjourned  [Music]  patreon shout outs thank